<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 7,400 MT were for Ireland (5,700 MT) and Belgium (1,700 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 10,600 MT were 19 percent above the 4-week average.  The destinations were Ireland (5,700 MT), Mexico (3,200 MT), and Belgium (1,700 MT).</p>
</text>
